  "description": "The northbound session record is closed. recording_path, a broker filesystem path that is audit data, must not appear in it. States are the session model's (§10): live and detached, and the two end states, killed (by TSB or through it) and terminated (from outside TSB); there is no disconnected state (decision 5.45). tier is 1–3; an active recording always carries the contract's warning code and text, unaltered. Consumers decode it strictly against this tag and ignore fields a later tag adds.",
